---
// src/pages/en/index.astro
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PortfolioCard from "../../components/PortfolioCard.astro";
import BackToTop from "../../components/BackToTop.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Bérangère Gallais | QA Automation Engineer / SDET"
  description="QA Automation Engineer / SDET & Technical Writer, available for a permanent or fixed-term position. Test automation (Cypress, Playwright, Selenium, Postman, k6), web development, AI agents (LangGraph, Claude API)."
  lang="en"
>
<div id="en-index-root">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 class="hero-title">QA Automation Engineer / SDET</h1>
        <p
          class="hero-tagline"
          style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; background-clip: text;"
        >
          Looking for a permanent or fixed-term position.
        </p>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          6 years of experience in software engineering, over 4 of which
          dedicated exclusively to test automation and technical
          documentation. I also build AI agents with LangGraph and the Claude
          API, and write technical documentation teams actually use.
        </p>

        <div class="value-props">
          <div class="value-prop">
            ◆ <strong>QA Automation / SDET</strong> : Cypress, Playwright, Selenium, Postman, k6
          </div>
          <div class="value-prop">
            ◆ <strong>Development</strong> : Java, Python, JavaScript/TypeScript
          </div>
          <div class="value-prop">
            ◆ <strong>AI agents</strong> : LangGraph, RAG, multi-agent architectures
          </div>
          <div class="value-prop">
            ◆ <strong>Technical Writing</strong> : Docs-as-Code, OpenAPI, API
            documentation, technical specifications
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="/en/portfolio" class="btn btn-primary">View my portfolio</a>
          <a href="/about/cv-bgallais-en.pdf" download class="btn btn-secondary">Download my CV</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="chat-preview">
        <div class="chat-header">
          <div class="agent-avatar">🤖</div>
          <div class="agent-info">
            <span class="agent-name">Documentation Assistant</span>
            <span class="agent-status">Online</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-messages">
          <div class="message user-message">
            <div class="message-avatar">👤</div>
            <div class="message-content">
              How to handle webhooks in case of error?
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="message agent-message">
            <div class="message-avatar">🤖</div>
            <div class="message-content">
              According to your technical documentation, here is the best practice:<br /><br />

              <strong>1. Implement exponential backoff</strong><br />
              Retry with progressive delays: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s...<br /><br />

              <strong>2. Store failed events</strong><br />
              Use a message queue (Redis, SQS) to replay webhooks later<br /><br />

              <strong>3. Enable failure notifications</strong><br />
              Configure alerts in your dashboard to monitor the error rate<br /><br />

              📄 <em style="color: #667eea;"
                >Source: Webhooks Documentation v2.1 (section 3.4)</em
              ><br /><br />

              Need a code example?
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile -->
  <section class="context-section section-spacing">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">My profile</h2>

      <div class="context-grid">
        <div class="context-card">
          <h3>What I'm looking for</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
              A <strong>permanent or fixed-term (CDI/CDD)</strong> position, where quality
              is a team effort
            </li>
            <li>
              A QA Automation Engineer / SDET role, or a position combining
              testing, development and documentation
            </li>
            <li>
              A team where I can apply my AI agent skills to real problems, if
              needed
            </li>
            <li>
              An environment where technical documentation matters as much as
              the code
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="context-card context-card--solution">
          <h3>What I bring</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <strong>4+ years dedicated to test automation</strong>: Cypress,
              Playwright, Selenium, the XRay-Cypress pipeline, Appium
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Combined dev + test skills</strong>: web development (Java,
              Angular) before specializing in QA
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>AI agents applied to the real world</strong>: multi-agent
              LangGraph architectures, RAG, LLM APIs (Claude, Gemini)
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Two-tier documentation</strong>: detailed technical report,
              accessible summary for non-technical readers
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="context-result">
        <p>
          These four skills aren't separate: my portfolio shows how they come
          together on projects I've carried end to end.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-services">
        <p>The full breakdown, section by section:</p>
        <div class="cta-services-buttons">
          <a href="/en/skills" class="btn btn-secondary">
            View my skills →
          </a>
          <a href="/en/portfolio" class="btn btn-secondary">
            View my portfolio →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Portfolio -->
  <section class="proof-section section-spacing">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title">Portfolio</h2>

      <div class="portfolio-grid-featured">
        <!-- Agent 1 : QA -->
        <div class="portfolio-featured-card">
          <div class="featured-badge featured-badge-conversational">
            AI Agents x Testing
          </div>
          <PortfolioCard
            title="QA Agent Supervisor"
            client="Multi-agent test orchestrator"
            description="Multi-agent LangGraph system that orchestrates a real Playwright/pytest test suite: coverage suggestions, failure triage, evidence-based flaky test detection."
            tags={["Python", "LangGraph", "Claude API", "Pydantic", "Playwright"]}
            image="/portfolio/qa-agent-supervisor.png"
            link="/en/portfolio/qa-agent-supervisor"
            category={["ai-agent", "qa"]}
            githubUrl="https://github.com/berangeregallais/qa-agent-supervisor"
            lang="en"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Agent 2 : RAG -->
        <div class="portfolio-featured-card">
          <div class="featured-badge featured-badge-rag">RAG Agent</div>
          <PortfolioCard
            title="Neolens Support Agent"
            client="API Technical Support"
            description="RAG agent for API documentation support. Smart search across 200+ pages, source citations."
            tags={["Python", "FastAPI", "LangGraph", "FAISS", "Next.js 14"]}
            image="/portfolio/01-home-welcome.png"
            link="/en/portfolio/neolens-support-agent"
            category={["ai-agent"]}
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cta-services">
        <div class="cta-services-buttons">
          <a href="/en/portfolio" class="btn btn-secondary">
            View the full portfolio →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Availability -->
  <section id="contact-cta" class="process-section section-spacing">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- CTA Section -->
      <div class="process-cta">
        <h3>Available for a permanent or fixed-term position</h3>
        <p>
          QA Automation Engineer / SDET & Technical Writer, looking for a team
          where my testing, development and AI agent skills can be applied to
          real problems.
        </p>
        <a href="/en/contact" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">Get in touch</a>
        <p class="process-link">
          <a href="/about/cv-bgallais-en.pdf" download>Download my CV →</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <BackToTop />

  <style>
    /* ===============================
     COULEURS PERSONNALISÉES POUR CETTE PAGE
     =============================== */
    :root {
      --color-background-custom: 5, 10, 48; /* #050a30 - Bleu foncé */
      --color-primary-custom: 238, 130, 255; /* #ee82ff - Rose moins saturé */
      --color-primary-hover-custom: 245, 150, 255; /* #f596ff - Rose clair pour hover */
      --color-accent-custom: 240, 170, 255; /* #f0aaff - Rose doux pour accents */
    }

    /* Override des variables de couleur pour cette page */
    #en-index-root {
      --color-background: 5, 10, 48;
      --color-primary: 90, 169, 230;
      --color-primary-hover: 124, 189, 238;
      --color-accent: 240, 170, 255;
      --color-surface: 15, 25, 65;
      --color-surface-variant: 25, 40, 90;
    }

    /* ===============================
     HERO SECTION
     =============================== */
    .hero {
      padding: 8rem 0 6rem;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgb(var(--color-background)) 0%,
        rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.05) 100%
      );
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(
          circle at 20% 80%,
          rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.08) 0%,
          transparent 50%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 80% 20%,
          rgba(var(--color-accent), 0.05) 0%,
          transparent 50%
        );
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero .container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 5rem;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-hero);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Value Props */
    .value-props {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .value-prop {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.5);
      border-left: 3px solid rgb(var(--color-primary));
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .value-prop:hover {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.7);
      transform: translateX(4px);
    }

    .value-prop strong {
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* Chat Preview */
    .chat-preview {
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      background: rgb(var(--color-surface));
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.3);
    }

    .chat-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      gap: 1rem;
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.3);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.2);
    }

    .agent-avatar {
      font-size: 2rem;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgb(var(--color-primary)),
        rgb(var(--color-primary-hover))
      );
    }

    .agent-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
    }

    .agent-name {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
    }

    .agent-status {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .agent-status::before {
      content: "●";
      color: rgb(var(--color-success));
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }

    .chat-messages {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      min-height: 320px;
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.1);
    }

    .message {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      max-width: 90%;
      animation: slideIn 0.3s ease;
    }

    .user-message {
      align-self: flex-end;
      flex-direction: row-reverse;
    }

    .agent-message {
      align-self: flex-start;
      animation: slideIn 0.3s ease 1s backwards;
    }

    .message-avatar {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .message-content {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      flex: 1;
      text-align: left;
      word-wrap: break-word;
      overflow-wrap: break-word;
      hyphens: auto;
    }

    .user-message .message-content {
      background: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-button));
      border-bottom-right-radius: 0.25rem;
    }

    .agent-message .message-content {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.8);
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      border-bottom-left-radius: 0.25rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.7);
    }

    @keyframes slideIn {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(10px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }

    /* ===============================
   CONTEXT SECTION
   =============================== */
    .context-section {
      background: rgb(var(--color-surface));
    }

    .context-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .context-card {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.3);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2.5rem;
    }

    .context-card--solution {
      background: rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.2);
    }

    .context-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .context-card ul {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .context-card ul li {
      padding-left: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      position: relative;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .context-card ul li::before {
      content: "•";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .context-card--solution ul li {
      padding-left: 2rem;
    }

    .context-card--solution ul li::before {
      content: "→";
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .context-card strong {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .context-result {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
      background: rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.05);
      border: 2px solid rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .context-result p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .context-result strong {
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
    }

    .cta-services {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2.5rem;
      padding: 2rem;
      background: rgba(var(--color-accent), 0.03);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .cta-services p {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .cta-services-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1rem;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .context-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .context-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .context-result {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }
    }

    /* ===============================
   USE CASES & METRICS
   =============================== */
    .use-cases {
      margin-top: 4rem;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.3);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .use-cases h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .use-cases-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    }

    .use-cases-list li {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      position: relative;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .use-cases-list li::before {
      content: "→";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .use-cases-list li strong {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ===============================
   APPROACH SECTION
   =============================== */
    .approach-section {
      background: rgb(var(--color-surface));
    }

    .approach-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .approach-card {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.3);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .approach-card h4 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    }

    .approach-card p {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    /* ===============================
   RESPONSIVE
   =============================== */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .approach-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .use-cases {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .approach-card {
        padding: 1.5rem;
      }

      .value-prop {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }
    }

    /* ===============================
   SECTIONS COMMUNES
   =============================== */
    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
    }

    /* ===============================
     BLOC SOLUTION
     =============================== */
    .solution-section {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.5);
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: rgb(var(--color-surface));
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .feature-card p strong {
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ===============================
     PROCESS SECTION - "Comment je travaille"
     =============================== */
    .process-section {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.5);
      padding-top: 2rem !important;
    }

    .process-cta {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      background: rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-primary), 0.2);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .process-cta h3 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .process-cta > p {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }

    .process-link {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
    }

    .process-link a {
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }

    .process-link a:hover {
      opacity: 0.8;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* ===============================
     BLOC PREUVE
     =============================== */
    .proof-section {
      background: rgba(var(--color-surface-variant), 0.5);
    }


    .proof-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .proof-image img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--color-border), 0.3);
    }

    .proof-text p {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .proof-text h4 {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .tech-stack {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .tech-stack li {
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      position: relative;
      color: rgb(var(--color-text-muted));
    }

    .tech-stack li::before {
      content: "▸";
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      color: rgb(var(--color-primary));
    }

    .tech-stack strong {
      color: rgb(var(--color-text));
    }

    /* ===============================
     DEMO VIDEO SECTION
     =============================== */
    .demo-video-section {
      margin-top: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 6rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .demo-video-section h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-size: 2rem;
